      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terminé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Télécharger"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each change has a menu. Pick **Leave On** or **Leave Off** to keep a setting as it is, for example when another app already manages it; only the other changes apply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque modification a un menu. Choisissez **Laisser activé** ou **Laisser désactivé** pour garder un réglage tel quel, par exemple quand une autre app le gère déjà ; seules les autres modifications s’appliquent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each folder sits beside the file of the tool that makes it, which builds it again when you need it. Projects you changed in the last week start unchecked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque dossier se trouve à côté du fichier de l’outil qui le crée, et qui le recrée quand vous en avez besoin. Les projets modifiés cette semaine sont décochés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Error": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erreur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every app installed with Homebrew is up to date.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toutes les apps installées avec Homebrew sont à jour."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every change is saved with the value from before, so you can undo it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque modification est enregistrée avec la valeur d’avant, vous pouvez donc l’annuler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every line is deleted. Your changes and their undo history are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toutes les lignes sont supprimées. Vos modifications et leur historique d’annulation sont conservés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every setting goes back to the value it had before, stopped services start again, and the Apple Intelligence profile is removed. You may be asked for your password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque réglage reprend sa valeur d’avant, les services arrêtés redémarrent et le profil Apple Intelligence est supprimé. Votre mot de passe peut vous être demandé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every setting, service, command, and app UnbloatMyMac changes is written here, from the app and from the command line tool.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque préférence, service, commande et app que UnbloatMyMac modifie est noté ici, depuis l’app comme depuis l’outil en ligne de commande."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every tweak in this file is already applied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tous les réglages de ce fichier sont déjà appliqués."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything UnbloatMyMac changed is back the way it was.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout ce qu’UnbloatMyMac avait modifié est revenu comme avant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export Activity Log": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exporter le journal d’activité"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export Activity Log…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exporter le journal d’activité…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export Log…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exporter le journal…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export Tweaks": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exporter les réglages"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export Tweaks…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exporter les réglages…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Failed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Échec"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Features marked Profile are turned off by a configuration profile. After you apply, approve it in System Settings > General > Device Management. Removing the profile turns them back on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les fonctions marquées Profil sont désactivées par un profil de configuration. Après application, approuvez-le dans Réglages Système > Général > Gestion des appareils. Supprimer le profil les réactive."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Files": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fichiers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Focus": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Concentration"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forget the changes you have not applied (Option-Command-Delete)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oublier les modifications non appliquées (Option-Commande-Supprimer)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free apps and tools that do a job better than macOS does, grouped by need. A star marks the pick in each group.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Des apps et outils gratuits qui font mieux que macOS, regroupés par besoin. Une étoile marque le choix de chaque groupe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free, open apps and tools that fill gaps in macOS, installed with Homebrew. Nothing installs until you click.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Des apps et outils gratuits et ouverts qui comblent les manques de macOS, installés avec Homebrew. Rien ne s’installe sans votre clic."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Depuis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From the command line tool": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Depuis l’outil en ligne de commande"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Général"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Getting Started": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Premiers pas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Here’s What Fits You": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voici ce qui vous convient"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide Log Inspector": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Masquer l’inspecteur du journal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "History": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Historique"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Homebrew installs the checked apps. Nothing installs until you click Install. You may be asked for your password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew installe les apps cochées. Rien ne s’installe avant que vous cliquiez sur Installer. Votre mot de passe peut vous être demandé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Homebrew is not installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew n’est pas installé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Homebrew is the free package manager most Mac developers use. UnbloatMyMac installs apps with it. Its installer runs in Terminal and asks for your password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew est le gestionnaire de paquets gratuit qu’utilisent la plupart des développeurs Mac. UnbloatMyMac s’en sert pour installer les apps. Son installeur s’exécute dans Terminal et demande votre mot de passe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How undo puts it back": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comment l’annulation le remet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I want everything back the way it was": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je veux tout remettre comme avant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import Tweaks": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importer les réglages"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import Tweaks…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importer les réglages…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inbox": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réception"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Info": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Info"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspector": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inspecteur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install %lld Apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installer %lld apps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install %lld Recommended…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installer %lld recommandées…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install 1 App": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installer 1 app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Command Line Tool…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installer l’outil en ligne de commande…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Recommended Apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installer les apps recommandées"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install Recommended Apps…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installer les apps recommandées…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed without Homebrew. Update and remove it the way you installed it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installée sans Homebrew. Mettez-la à jour et supprimez-la comme vous l’avez installée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed. It updates itself; move it to the Trash to remove it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installée. Elle se met à jour toute seule ; placez-la dans la corbeille pour la supprimer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed. Open a new Terminal window to use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installé. Ouvrez une nouvelle fenêtre de Terminal pour l’utiliser."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed. Try “unbloatmymac list” in Terminal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installé. Essayez « unbloatmymac list » dans Terminal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing %lld of %lld: %@…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installation %lld sur %lld : %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installation…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Items for every user (daemons) ask for your password. **Show Login Items…** reads the login items and app background items listed in System Settings; that also needs your password. Turn those on or off in **System Settings > General > Login Items & Extensions**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les éléments pour tous les utilisateurs (daemons) demandent votre mot de passe. **Afficher les éléments d’ouverture…** lit les éléments d’ouverture et les éléments d’arrière-plan listés dans Réglages Système, ce qui demande aussi votre mot de passe. Activez-les ou désactivez-les dans **Réglages Système > Général > Ouverture et extensions**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep as Is": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laisser ainsi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyboard Shortcuts": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raccourcis clavier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Language": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Langue"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave Off": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laisser désactivé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave On": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laisser activé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leftovers from Deleted Apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restes d’apps supprimées"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Level": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Niveau"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lines": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lignes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lines are in English, like Console, so they read the same in a bug report. The log keeps the latest 5,000 lines in **activity.log**, next to the journal. **Clear Log…** deletes them; it does not undo anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les lignes sont en anglais, comme dans Console, pour se lire pareil dans un rapport de bug. Le journal garde les 5 000 dernières lignes dans **activity.log**, à côté de journal.json. **Effacer le journal…** les supprime ; cela n’annule rien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Log out and back in to finish every change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Déconnectez-vous puis reconnectez-vous pour terminer toutes les modifications."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Log out to finish.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Déconnectez-vous pour terminer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Login Items and App Background Items": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouverture et éléments en arrière-plan des apps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Login items and app background items need your password to read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La lecture des éléments d’ouverture et en arrière-plan demande votre mot de passe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looks once a day for a new version on GitHub.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cherche une nouvelle version sur GitHub une fois par jour."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looks once a day for a new version on GitHub. Last checked %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cherche une nouvelle version sur GitHub une fois par jour. Dernière recherche %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Message": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Message"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "More for %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plus pour %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Most changes show at once. Some take effect in apps you open from now on, or after you log out; the review says which. To see Dock, Finder, and menu bar changes only after logging out, turn off **Restart the Dock, Finder, and menu bar after applying** in **Settings**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La plupart des modifications sont visibles tout de suite. Certaines s’appliquent aux apps ouvertes ensuite, ou après déconnexion ; la vérification indique lesquelles. Pour ne voir les changements du Dock, du Finder et de la barre des menus qu’après déconnexion, désactivez **Redémarrer le Dock, le Finder et la barre des menus après application** dans **Réglages**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move %lld to Trash (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Placer %1$lld éléments dans la corbeille (%2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move to Trash": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Placer dans la corbeille"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs attention": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À vérifier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Newest": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La plus récente"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Newest kept": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La plus récente est gardée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Activity Yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune activité"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Background Items": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun élément en arrière-plan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Changes Yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune modification"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Xcode device support found. Xcode adds it when you run an app on a connected device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune prise en charge d’appareils Xcode. Xcode l’ajoute quand vous lancez une app sur un appareil connecté."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No build files found in Developer, Projects, Code, or src.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun fichier de compilation dans Developer, Projects, Code ou src."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No installed app uses these, and nothing changed them in 30 days. Checked items move to the Trash; put them back from there if an app misses them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune app installée ne les utilise, et rien ne les a modifiés depuis 30 jours. Les éléments cochés vont dans la corbeille ; remettez-les en place depuis là si une app en a besoin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No installers found in Downloads. Ones from the last day are left out, since you may still be using them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun installateur dans Téléchargements. Ceux du dernier jour sont écartés, vous les utilisez peut-être encore."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No leftovers found. Every app with files in your Library is still installed, or used them in the last 30 days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun reste trouvé. Chaque app qui a des fichiers dans votre Bibliothèque est encore installée, ou les a utilisés ces 30 derniers jours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No login items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun élément d’ouverture."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No old versions found. Only the newest version of each device is here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune ancienne version. Seule la plus récente de chaque appareil est là."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No other app installed a launch agent or daemon.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune autre app n’a installé d’agent ou de démon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not in Homebrew. Opens %@ to download it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
