            "value": "Afficher ou masquer le détail de la ligne sélectionnée (Contrôle-Commande-I)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show or hide the log inspector": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher ou masquer l’inspecteur du journal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show the lines about one part of the Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher les lignes d’une partie du Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Simulators and local snapshots cannot go to the Trash: they are deleted at once, and the page says so before. Some items open their page in System Settings instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les simulateurs et les instantanés locaux ne peuvent pas aller à la Corbeille : ils sont supprimés tout de suite, et la page le dit avant. Certains éléments ouvrent plutôt leur page dans Réglages Système."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Since": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Depuis le"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some Changes Didn’t Apply": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Certaines modifications n’ont pas été appliquées"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some Tweaks Were Put Back": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Certains réglages ont été rétablis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some changes could not be undone:": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Certaines modifications n’ont pas pu être annulées :"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some changes show in apps you open from now on, and everywhere after you log out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Certaines modifications s’appliquent aux apps ouvertes à partir de maintenant, et partout après déconnexion."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some settings are protected. Give UnbloatMyMac Full Disk Access, then apply them again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Certains réglages sont protégés. Donnez à UnbloatMyMac l’accès complet au disque, puis appliquez-les de nouveau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Something reset settings UnbloatMyMac changed. Open UnbloatMyMac to apply them again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quelque chose a réinitialisé des réglages modifiés par UnbloatMyMac. Ouvrez UnbloatMyMac pour les appliquer à nouveau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Source": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Source"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stage this preset’s tweaks. Review them before anything changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Préparer les réglages de ce préréglage. Vous les vérifiez avant tout changement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start on the Overview": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Commencez par la vue d’ensemble"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Status": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "État"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop this item and keep it from starting at login": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêter cet élément et l’empêcher de démarrer à l’ouverture de session"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped services fully stop after you log out and back in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les services arrêtés s’arrêtent complètement après une déconnexion puis reconnexion."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops a service": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrête un service"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Storage": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stockage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch a single tweak back and apply to undo it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rebasculez un réglage et appliquez pour l’annuler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches follow System Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les interrupteurs suivent Réglages Système"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches only stage changes. The toolbar counts them, and the sidebar shows a badge on each category with changes waiting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les interrupteurs ne font que préparer des modifications. La barre d’outils les compte, et la barre latérale affiche un badge sur chaque catégorie qui en attend."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switching them all back on removes the profile, which asks for your password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les réactiver tous supprime le profil, ce qui demande votre mot de passe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Système (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Settings opens with a profile. Approve it in General > Device Management to finish the Apple Intelligence changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réglages Système s’ouvre avec un profil. Approuvez-le dans Général > Gestion des appareils pour terminer les modifications Apple Intelligence."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell me when macOS puts back tweaks": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me prévenir quand macOS remet des réglages"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminal tools like Oh My Posh or zoxide can add their line to ~/.zshrc, inside a block UnbloatMyMac marks and removes again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les outils du Terminal comme Oh My Posh ou zoxide peuvent ajouter leur ligne à ~/.zshrc, dans un bloc qu’UnbloatMyMac marque et retire ensuite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The **Activity Log** lists everything UnbloatMyMac did to your Mac, line by line: each setting it wrote, each service it stopped, each command it ran, each file it changed, and each app it installed, from the app and from the command line tool.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le **Journal d’activité** liste tout ce qu’UnbloatMyMac a fait à votre Mac, ligne par ligne : chaque préférence écrite, chaque service arrêté, chaque commande exécutée, chaque fichier modifié et chaque app installée, depuis l’app comme depuis l’outil en ligne de commande."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The **Overview** lists tweaks macOS put back. Click **Review and Apply Again**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La **Vue d’ensemble** liste les réglages que macOS a rétablis. Cliquez sur **Vérifier et réappliquer**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The **Source** menu shows one part of the Mac, like **Preferences** or **Commands**. Search finds words in the message and the command.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le menu **Source** affiche une partie du Mac, comme **Préférences** ou **Commandes**. La recherche trouve les mots dans le message et dans la commande."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The background model services are separate tweaks that stop launch agents; they are marked **Advanced**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les services de modèles en arrière-plan sont des réglages à part qui arrêtent des agents ; ils sont marqués **Avancé**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The command line tool is removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’outil en ligne de commande est supprimé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The install command is on the clipboard. Paste it into Terminal, press Return, then come back and refresh.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La commande d’installation est dans le presse-papiers. Collez-la dans Terminal, appuyez sur Retour, puis revenez et actualisez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The log keeps the latest 5,000 lines. Lines are in English, so you can paste them in a bug report.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le journal garde les 5 000 dernières lignes. Elles sont en anglais, pour pouvoir les coller dans un rapport de bug."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new language applies after a restart.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La nouvelle langue s’applique après un redémarrage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The profile is waiting for you. Open **System Settings > General > Device Management**, double-click the UnbloatMyMac profile, and click **Install**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le profil vous attend. Ouvrez **Réglages Système > Général > Gestion des appareils**, double-cliquez sur le profil UnbloatMyMac, puis cliquez sur **Installer**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved values are in **journal.json**. **Settings > General > Show in Finder** shows it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les valeurs enregistrées sont dans **journal.json**. **Réglages > Général > Afficher dans le Finder** le montre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The value of every setting before UnbloatMyMac changed it is kept here, so Undo Everything can put it back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La valeur de chaque réglage avant modification est conservée ici, pour que Tout annuler puisse la rétablir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These apps install with Homebrew. Install it from Recommended Apps first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces apps s’installent avec Homebrew. Installez-le d’abord depuis Apps recommandées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These files move to the Trash. You can put them back until you empty it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces fichiers vont dans la corbeille. Vous pouvez les récupérer tant qu’elle n’est pas vidée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Third-party background items": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Éléments tiers en arrière-plan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Log": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce journal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Impossible d’annuler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This setting stays as it is": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce réglage reste tel quel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three steps": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trois étapes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Heure"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tools": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Outils"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Troubleshooting": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dépannage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn %@ on or off": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer ou désactiver %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off what you don’t use. Every change is optional, shown before it applies, and can be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivez ce que vous n’utilisez pas. Chaque modification est facultative, montrée avant d’être appliquée et réversible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on every tweak on this page. Nothing changes until you review and apply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer tous les réglages de cette page. Rien ne change avant que vous vérifiiez et appliquiez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on in new Terminal windows": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer dans les nouvelles fenêtres de Terminal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on to apply, off to undo": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activez pour appliquer, désactivez pour annuler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn switches off or on. Nothing changes yet: the change waits in the toolbar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activez ou désactivez des interrupteurs. Rien ne change encore : la modification attend dans la barre d’outils."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn these on or off in System Settings > General > Login Items & Extensions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activez-les ou désactivez-les dans Réglages Système > Général > Ouverture et extensions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turns off": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se désactive"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turns on": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S’active"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tweak": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réglage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tweaks": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réglages"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tweaks and Presets": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réglages et préréglages"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tweaks applied": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réglages appliqués"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tweaks are grouped in the sidebar: **Apple Intelligence**, **Privacy**, **Security**, **Performance**, **Annoyances**, **Finder**, **Dock & Windows**, **Typing**, and **Windows Mode**. Each says what it does when its switch is on, and tags say what it needs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les réglages sont regroupés dans la barre latérale : **Apple Intelligence**, **Confidentialité**, **Sécurité**, **Performances**, **Désagréments**, **Finder**, **Dock et fenêtres**, **Saisie** et **Mode Windows**. Chacun dit ce qu’il fait quand son interrupteur est activé, et des étiquettes disent ce qu’il demande."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tweaks that stop system services. Some features stop working until you undo them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réglages qui arrêtent des services système. Certaines fonctions cessent de marcher jusqu’à l’annulation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unbloat All": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout alléger"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unbloat Your Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allégez votre Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UnbloatMyMac": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UnbloatMyMac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UnbloatMyMac Help": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aide UnbloatMyMac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UnbloatMyMac Settings.unbloat.json": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réglages UnbloatMyMac.unbloat.json"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UnbloatMyMac is in English and French. It follows your Mac's language unless you pick one in **Settings > General > Language**. The new language applies after **Restart Now**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UnbloatMyMac est en anglais et en français. Il suit la langue de votre Mac, sauf si vous en choisissez une dans **Réglages > Général > Langue**. La nouvelle langue s’applique après **Redémarrer maintenant**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UnbloatMyMac on GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UnbloatMyMac sur GitHub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UnbloatMyMac only reports these. Change them in System Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UnbloatMyMac ne fait que les signaler. Modifiez-les dans Réglages Système."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UnbloatMyMac turns off what you don't use: Apple Intelligence, telemetry, slow animations, pop-ups, and background updaters. Every tweak is optional, shown to you before it applies, and can be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UnbloatMyMac désactive ce dont vous ne vous servez pas : Apple Intelligence, la télémétrie, les animations lentes, les fenêtres surgissantes et les programmes de mise à jour en arrière-plan. Chaque réglage est facultatif, vous est montré avant d’être appliqué, et peut être annulé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uncheck All": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout décocher"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undid %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ annulé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo Everything": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout annuler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo Everything…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout annuler…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo History": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Historique d’annulation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo and History": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Annulation et historique"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo every tweak on this page": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Annuler tous les réglages de cette page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo everything UnbloatMyMac changed?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Annuler tout ce qu’UnbloatMyMac a modifié ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undone": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Annulé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uninstall": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désinstaller"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uninstall Command Line Tool…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désinstaller l’outil en ligne de commande…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inconnu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mettre à jour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update %lld Apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mettre à jour %lld apps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update 1 App": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mettre à jour 1 app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update All Apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mettre à jour toutes les apps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updaters and helpers other apps start at login and keep running. Switch one off to stop it; switch it on to bring it back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Programmes de mise à jour et assistants que d’autres apps lancent à l’ouverture de session et laissent tourner. Désactivez-en un pour l’arrêter ; réactivez-le pour le ramener."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updaters and helpers that other apps start at login and keep running, like Google Updater or Adobe's helpers. Switch one off to stop it; switch it on to bring it back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les programmes de mise à jour et assistants que d’autres apps lancent à l’ouverture de session et laissent tourner, comme Google Updater ou les assistants d’Adobe. Désactivez-en un pour l’arrêter ; réactivez-le pour le faire revenir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mises à jour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates are off in this build.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les mises à jour sont désactivées dans cette version."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updating %lld of %lld: %@…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mise à jour %lld sur %lld : %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the same tweaks on another Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les mêmes réglages sur un autre Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wait for the changes to finish": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Attendez la fin des modifications"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warning": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avertissement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What %@ changes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que change %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Happens": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qui va se passer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What a tweak changes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que change un réglage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it changes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qu’il change"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's New": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nouveautés"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Homebrew has a newer version of an app it installed, its row shows **Update**, and **Update N Apps** updates them all. **Changes > Check for App Updates** (⌥⌘U) asks Homebrew for the latest versions first. Apps that update themselves are left to do so.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand Homebrew a une version plus récente d’une app qu’il a installée, sa ligne affiche **Mettre à jour**, et **Mettre à jour N apps** les met toutes à jour. **Modifications > Rechercher les mises à jour des apps** (⌥⌘U) demande d’abord les dernières versions à Homebrew. Les apps qui se mettent à jour seules s’en chargent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Will turn off": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sera désactivé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Will turn on": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sera activé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Xcode copies the newest version again, which takes several minutes, the next time you connect this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Xcode copie à nouveau la version la plus récente, ce qui prend plusieurs minutes, la prochaine fois que vous connectez cet appareil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can download these again from where they came from. A disk image that wasn’t downloaded may be one you made, so it starts unchecked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous pouvez les télécharger à nouveau depuis leur source. Une image disque qui n’a pas été téléchargée est peut-être la vôtre, elle est donc décochée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac Is Already Set Up": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre Mac est déjà configuré"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Setup": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre configuration"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "git, clang, and make, which Homebrew and most code need. Apple’s installer opens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "git, clang et make, dont Homebrew et la plupart du code ont besoin. L’installateur d’Apple s’ouvre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS Was Updated": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS a été mis à jour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS asks for your password once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS demande votre mot de passe une seule fois."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS put back %lld tweaks": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS a remis %lld réglages"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS removes these when you turn off Apple Intelligence": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS les supprime quand vous désactivez Apple Intelligence"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "of %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
